## .NET build output
**/bin/
**/obj/

## Local publish output (e.g. `dotnet publish -o <folder>`)
## `bin/` and `obj/` only cover in-place builds. Agents or scripts that
## publish to a custom folder at the repo root dump ~130 regenerable
## artifact files plus a copy of appsettings — ignore those folders here.
/build_verify/
/publish/
**/publish/
**/Publish/

## User- and machine-specific files
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.rsuser

## Visual Studio / VS Code / Rider / Cursor
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.cursor/

## Python cache (tools/seeder/gen_seeder.py)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

## Local assistant / tooling state
.claude/

## Logs
*.log

## Local app configuration (copy from appsettings.Development.json.example)
BevosTunesMVC/appsettings.Development.json
BevosTunesMVC/appsettings.*.local.json

## Local-only docs and agent instructions (README.md is the only public doc)
/docs/
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

## OS / merge noise
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.orig
~$*.xlsx
